    B_SET -- Softmax Attention w_b,n --> DELTA
    SAMPLES -- Feature Encoder ϕ_θ --> CN
    CN == "Weight: 1 - α" ==> CALIB_NODE
    DELTA == Weight: α ==> CALIB_NODE
    CALIB_NODE --> RESULT
    ALPHA0 -- Shrinkage Vector Pulling --> ALPHA_OPT
    ALPHA_OPT -- "Over-Shrinkage" --> ALPHA1
    RESULT -. "MSE = Bias² + Var ≪ Var(c_n)" .-> THEORETICAL_FOUNDATION

